{"id":"8bd8856654616e19","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-continuous.md","title":"Continuous Function (on Reals)","display":"df-continuous — Continuous Function (on Reals)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-continuous","aliases":["58-df-continuous"],"display":"df-continuous — Continuous Function (on Reals)","depends_on":["[[58-df-reals]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-continuous"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-continuous</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-continuous — Continuous Function (on Reals)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"58-df-reals\">58-df-reals</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span> (real field, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"58-df-reals\">58-df-reals</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\">\\(f\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (function graph, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_{\\mathbb R}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_{\\mathbb R}(f)\\)</span> (continuity predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous} \\vdash \\mathrm{Continuous}_{\\mathbb R}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(|x-y|&lt;\\delta\\to|f(x)-f(y)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous} \\vdash \\mathrm{Continuous}_{\\mathbb R}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(|x-y|&lt;\\delta\\to|f(x)-f(y)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalently, in the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> formulation: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x \\in \\mathbb{R}\\; \\forall \\varepsilon &gt; 0\\; \\exists \\delta &gt; 0\\; \\forall y \\in \\mathbb{R}\\; (|x - y| &lt; \\delta \\to |f(x) - f(y)| &lt; \\varepsilon)\">\\(\\forall x \\in \\mathbb{R}\\; \\forall \\varepsilon &gt; 0\\; \\exists \\delta &gt; 0\\; \\forall y \\in \\mathbb{R}\\; (|x - y| &lt; \\delta \\to |f(x) - f(y)| &lt; \\varepsilon)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>In the Wadge hierarchy context, continuous reductions are the key tool for comparing complexity of sets of reals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-reals","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-reals]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-reals","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb R$ (real field, see [[58-df-reals]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in V$ with $\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)$ (function graph, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_{\\mathbb R}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous} \\vdash \\mathrm{Continuous}_{\\mathbb R}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(|x-y|<\\delta\\to|f(x)-f(y)|<\\varepsilon\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x \\in \\mathbb{R}\\; \\forall \\varepsilon > 0\\; \\exists \\delta > 0\\; \\forall y \\in \\mathbb{R}\\; (|x - y| < \\delta \\to |f(x) - f(y)| < \\varepsilon)","display":false}],"bytes":1190,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-continuous]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-360","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-continuous.md|58-df-continuous]]（batch20）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-31","location